.TH PPG 1 "June 2026" "personal-pass-generator 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ppg \- generate focused personalized password candidate lists
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ppg
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Personal Pass Generator creates focused password candidate wordlists for
authorized password-security assessments. Without seed words it starts an
interactive workflow.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-word " " VALUE
Add a seed value. Repeat this option to provide multiple values.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " PATH
Write candidates to PATH.
.TP
.B \-\-leet
Add leet-speak variants.
.TP
.B \-\-symbols
Add bounded prefix and suffix mutations.
.TP
.BR \-\-min-length " " N
Set the minimum candidate length.
.TP
.BR \-\-max-length " " N
Set the maximum candidate length.
.SH EXAMPLE
.B ppg --word alice --word acme --leet --min-length 8 --max-length 14 -o candidates.txt
